Upstream project
----------------

AnyPS5
  https://github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5
  Created by boykopovar (first commit: 3 August 2026), with code from more
  than 500 contributors. The complete authorship of every upstream line is
  preserved in this repository's git history (git log, git blame).

NativeFrame keeps the AnyPS5 history unchanged and builds on it: the
relinker, the reimplemented system libraries, the AGC/PM4 to Vulkan driver
and the RDNA to SPIR-V shader recompiler are AnyPS5 work. NativeFrame adds
performance work on top of it (see docs/research/).

Fixes that are generic and not specific to NativeFrame are meant to be
offered back to AnyPS5 under its own contribution rules.


